OL,3,GNEWSAGritter drivers ready 24/7 for
OL,4,Acold, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FGritter drivers are being made
OL,7,Favailable around the clock to help keep
OL,8,Fresidents in Surrey moving as the
OL,9,Fcolder months begin, the council has
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FSurrey County Council said a fleet of
OL,13,F38 gritting vehicles typically travel
OL,14,Fmore than 1,775 miles (2,856km) of its
OL,15,Fbusiest roads before and during severe
OL,16,Fweather.
OL,18,FWinter road plans tend to run from
OL,19,FOctober until the end of March, but can
OL,20,Fbe extended depending on the weather,
OL,21,Fit said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
